abstract: "Two open datasets. Dataset A scores 24 organizations that evaluate frontier models for safety-relevant properties on eight independence dimensions, every value derived from sourced signals under published rules. Dataset B codes the lifecycle of sixteen assurance regimes across fifteen industries as dated milestones. Everything regenerates from an append-only event log."
